      "source": "To Setup Crontab"
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219884,
      "translationId": 2527775,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "För att köra SuiteCRM-schemaläggare",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_LINUX_DESC1']",
      "source": "In order to run SuiteCRM Schedulers"
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219886,
      "translationId": 2527777,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "1. Redigera crontab-filen för webbserveranvändaren med det här kommandot",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_LINUX_DESC2']",
      "source": "1. Edit your web server user's crontab file with this command"
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219888,
      "translationId": 2527779,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "2. Uppdatera sedan crontab-filen och lägg till följande rad:",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_LINUX_DESC3']",
      "source": "2. Then update and add the following line to the crontab file:"
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219890,
      "translationId": 2527781,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "Gör detta först när installationen är klar.",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_LINUX_DESC4']",
      "source": "You should do this only after the installation is concluded."
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219892,
      "translationId": 2527783,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "2(i). Lägg till följande rad för att ange miljövariablerna:",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_LINUX_DESC5']",
      "source": "2(i). To define the environment variables, add the following line:"
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219894,
      "translationId": 2527785,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "Uppdatera [path/to/php] och [path/to/suite/instance] så att de motsvarar din miljö.",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_LINUX_DESC6']",
      "source": "Please update [path/to/php] and [path/to/suite/instance] to reflect your environment."
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219896,
      "translationId": 2527787,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "För att köra SuiteCRM-schemaläggare",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_WINDOWS_DESC']",
      "source": "In order to run the SuiteCRM Schedulers"
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219898,
      "translationId": 2527789,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "1. Skapa en batchfil som ska köras med Windows Schemalagda aktiviteter. Batchfilen ska innehålla följande kommandon:",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_WINDOWS_DESC2']",
      "source": "1. Create a batch file to run using Windows Scheduled Tasks. The batch file should include the following commands:"
    },
    {
      "stringId": 219900,
      "translationId": 2527791,
      "status": 201,
      "target": "Uppdatera [path\\to\\php.exe] och [path\\to\\suite\\instance] så att de motsvarar din miljö.",
      "identifier": "$mod_strings['LBL_CRON_WINDOWS_DESC3']",
      "source": "Please update [path\\to\\php.exe] and [path\\to\\suite\\instance] to reflect your environment."
    },
